    <description><![CDATA[<p><span> 这周的游戏圈信息量拉满：年度顶流《GTA6》发售带火了硬件和线下业态，国产显卡、国产游戏接连迎来突破性进展，国际厂商既有引擎迭代的大动作也有驱动翻车的争议，还有电竞新纪录和多款待发售大作的新动态.</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a></span></strong><strong><span> GTA6带动硬件与线下游戏热潮</span></strong><br><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="311">05:11</a></span></strong><strong><span> 国产GPU冲击高端市场与显卡改装热</span></strong><br><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="552">09:12</a></span></strong><strong><span> AI挑战数学与科技护城河</span></strong><br><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="688">11:28</a></span></strong><strong><span> TGA2026国产游戏提名引热议，行业利好与粉圈对立并存</span></strong><br><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="906">15:06</a></span></strong><strong><span> APEC虚幻引擎6重构计划引发游戏开发行业变革</span></strong><br><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1090">18:10</a></span></strong><strong><span> 英伟达显卡驱动问题</span></strong><br><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1379">22:59</a></span></strong><strong><span> 媒体与玩家对GTA游戏评分分歧及PS5与PC平台讨论</span></strong><br><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1574">26:14</a></span></strong><strong><span> S16全球总决赛：中国赛区夺冠</span></strong><br><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1697">28:17</a></span></strong><strong><span> 怪物猎人旅人回归，PC端与V Game平台的双重策略</span></strong><br></p>]]></description>
